        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "02 - Propulsion",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "REAL ENGINE LOSSES:\n  Pumping losses (intake/exhaust strokes)\n  Heat transfer to cylinder walls\n  Incomplete combustion\n  Blow-by (leakage past rings)\n  Friction"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-PROPULSION.md#013",
      "path": [
        "02-PROPULSION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
