      "text": "TEMPERATURE RATIOS:\n  T₂/T₁ = (p₂/p₁)^((γ-1)/γ) = OPR^((γ-1)/γ)  [compressor exit]\n  OPR = Overall Pressure Ratio = p₂/p₁\n  T₄/T₃ = (p₄/p₃)^((γ-1)/γ)  [turbine exit]\n  T₃ = Turbine Inlet Temperature (TIT); limited by material → ~1800-2000 K with cooling"
